  "sufficiency": "Every named facet needs explicit respondent-answer support at the level of usual self-description, including the relevant context/condition. A question being asked, a supplied stimulus premise, a hidden dossier fact, or a moral norm is not support. An explicit usual absence can be described; unknown, inapplicable, declined, and unasked stay separate from sufficient.",
  "evidence_limit": "Usual hypothetical self-description is not a real episode or an independently observed capacity, causal mechanism, frequency, or chart feature. No dossier fact is admissible as extracted-answer evidence.",
  "scope_limit": "The 23-domain registry is a development coverage blueprint assembled for a historical owner regression, not a complete universal AstroHD chart-observable specification. The broader ten-domain blueprint is cross-checked without pretending it supplies a complete inverse chart model.",
  "supersedes_for_this_design_pass": "requirements.json; original bytes retained",
  "amendment_reason": "Broader scored constructs in docs/17_v3_6_profile_mapping_coverage_audit.md are not fully represented by the historical 23-domain checklist."
